WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
I'm not very young, what's going on in my head?

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Really

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,100
I just want to talk to you about something

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,220
If what you say satisfies me

5
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:14,220
Then I'll help you solve this matter

6
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:15,700
So that's it

7
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,700
As long as the sleeves are not broken

8
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:18,700
The rest is up to you

9
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,700
The imperial court had a supervisory censor

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,700
Why do you assert that His Majesty does not know what is going on outside?

11
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,410
Said to be a supervisory censor

12
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:29,410
It's just a biting dog in someone else's hands

13
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:32,410
There are a few who are dedicated to national affairs.

14
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:33,410
What do you think

15
00:00:33,410 --> 00:00:36,410
How can we prevent His Majesty from being deceived?

16
00:00:36,410 --> 00:00:40,620
Just raise another one that's more handsome than Yushe.

17
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,620
The disaster in Shandong and Shanxi is not over yet

18
00:00:43,620 --> 00:00:45,620
The Northern Barbarians want to pay tribute again

19
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:54,030
With internal and external troubles, how can there be any spare money?

20
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:55,030
What did you just say

21
00:00:55,030 --> 00:00:57,030
If my guess is right

22
00:00:57,030 --> 00:01:01,800
You should be Prince Su, right?

23
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:04,860
We, Chengguo Mansion, cannot bear Prince Su’s love.

24
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:07,180
Since the emperor wants to punish me

25
00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:09,410
That means he still doesn't know the truth of the matter

26
00:01:09,410 --> 00:01:11,980
That being the case

27
00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:13,980
I will write a letter to my father
